{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1788347842006,"sessionID":"ses_f9e29a5e6ffeV9NZot5d8hM5Gt","part":{"id":"prt_061d67dd2001s7ogUmNoTWLEn0","messageID":"msg_061d66eab0015jMNq7PXDjeAvc","sessionID":"ses_f9e29a5e6ffeV9NZot5d8hM5Gt","snapshot":"","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788348074128,"sessionID":"ses_f9e29a5e6ffeV9NZot5d8hM5Gt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_3be99718ae544b6395589a2a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/aloschilov/workspace/pyasc-skill-stack/integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/20260902_140812/gelu-generate/design.md","content":"# GELU Kernel Design\n\n## Algorithm\n\nTwo modes dispatched by host string comparison on `approximate`:\n\n### Exact mode (`\"none\"`)\n- **x >= 0**: `y = x * 0.5 * (1 + erf(x / sqrt(2)))`\n- **x < 0**: `y = x * 0.5 * erfc(|x| / sqrt(2))`\n  - erfc via Numerical Recipes rational fit: `t * exp(-z^2 + P(t))`, `t = 1 / (1 + 0.5 * z)`, 9-coefficient Horner, rel err < 1.2e-7\n- Blend with `asc2.where(xf >= 0.0, erf_path, erfc_path)`\n- Final `-inf` guard: `y = asc2.where(xf > -3e38, y, 0.0)` to avoid `-inf * 0 = NaN`\n\n### Tanh mode (`\"tanh\"`)\n- `u = sqrt(2/pi) * (x + 0.044715 * x^3)`\n- `1 + tanh(u) = 2 * sigmoid(2u)` (cancellation-free identity)\n- `sigmoid(s) = where(s >= 0, 1/(1+e), e/(1+e))` where `e = exp(-|s|)` (one exp call)\n- `y = x * sigmoid(2u)`\n- Final `-inf` guard same as exact mode\n\n### Special values\n| Input | Behavior |\n|-------|----------|\n| x = 0 | y = 0 naturally (both paths) |\n| x = +inf | y = +inf naturally |\n| x = -inf | Guarded to 0 by `where(xf > -3e38, ...)` |\n| x = NaN | Propagates IEEE NaN, golden also NaN |\n\n## Pinned-v2 APIs\n\n| Operation | API |\n|-----------|-----|\n| Global memory views | `asc2.global_tensor(ptr, [size])` |\n| Tile load/store | `asc2.copy_in(gm, [off], [TILE], real_shape=[n])` / `asc2.copy_out(tile, gm, [off], real_shape=[n])` |\n| Tile loop | `asc2.range(block_idx, num_tiles, block_num, unroll_factor=2)` |\n| Dtype promotion | `x.to(asc.float32)` / `y.to(x.dtype)` |\n| Math ops | `asc2.erf`, `asc2.exp`, `asc2.abs`, `asc2.tanh` (unused—replaced by sigmoid), `asc2.sqrt`, `asc2.div` |\n| Tile arithmetic | `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` (scalar always on RIGHT), `asc2.where`, comparisons |\n| Constants | Module-level `math.sqrt(2.0)`, `math.sqrt(2.0 / math.pi)`, etc.; `asc.ConstExpr[int]` for TILE |\n\n## All 20 Cases Coverage\n\n| Case | numel | dtype | range | mode | notes |\n|------|-------|-------|-------|------|-------|\n| 1 | 1M | f16 | [-1,1] | none | small range, erf direct |\n| 2 | 4M | f32 | [-2,2] | none | moderate, erfc path active |\n| 3 | 16M | bf16 | [-3,3] | none | erfc critical (bf16 erf rounds to -1 at z=2.12) |\n| 4 | 64M | f16 | [-10,10] | tanh | largest shape |\n| 5 | 64M | f32 | [-100,100] | tanh | large range, sigmoid stable |\n| 6 | ~1M | bf16 | [-0.1,0.1] | tanh | tiny range, tail |\n| 7 | ~1M | f16 | [-1,2] | none | non-power-of-2, tail |\n| 8 | ~1.2M | f32 | [-5,10] | tanh | tail |\n| 9 | ~50M | bf16 | [-50,100] | none | erfc for large neg |\n| 10 | ~1M | f16 | [-65504,65504] | tanh | f16 max range |\n| 11 | ~1M | f32 | [-88,88] | none | erfc critical (z up to 62) |\n| 12 | 1M | bf16 | [-inf,inf] | tanh | -inf guard needed |\n| 13 | ~170K | f32 | [nan,nan] | none | NaN propagation OK |\n| 14 | ~3M | f16 | [0,0] | tanh | all-zeros input |\n| 15 | ~1M | f32 | [-0.5,0.5] | none | small range |\n| 16 | ~2M | bf16 | [-1,3] | none | tail, bf16 erfc |\n| 17 | ~2M | f16 | [-1000,1000] | tanh | large f16 range |\n| 18 | ~2M | f32 | [-0.2,0.2] | none | tiny range |\n| 19 | ~2M | bf16 | [-3,6] | tanh | normal |\n| 20 | ~10.5M | f32 | [-20,40] | none | 5D, erfc active |\n\n## Tiling & Tails\n\n- **Flatten** all inputs to 1D (`size = x.numel()`). Output shape preserved via `torch.empty_like`.\n- **Grid-stride loop**: `for t in asc2.range(block_idx, num_tiles, block_num, unroll_factor=2)`\n- **Tail handling**: `n = TILE if off + TILE <= size else size - off`; passed via `real_shape=[n]`\n- **Cores**: `min(72, num_tiles)`\n\n## TILE Sizes & UB Budget\n\n### Exact kernel (TILE=1024)\nPeak f32 tiles: ~7 (x_f32, z_or_zabs, t_or_erf, poly, erfc_or_erf_path, cond_mask, result)\n- Naive: 7 * 4 * 1024 = 28,672 B\n- Calibrated (1.6x): 45,875 B\n- With unroll=2: **91,750 B < 253,952 B**\n\n### Tanh kernel (TILE=2048)\nPeak f32 tiles: ~7 (x_f32, x2_or_inner, s_or_neg_abs, e, denom, sig_or_cond, result)\n- Naive: 7 * 4 * 2048 = 57,344 B\n- Calibrated (1.6x): 91,750 B\n- With unroll=2: **183,500 B < 253,952 B**\n\n## Numerical Risks & Mitigations\n\n| Risk | Affected cases | Mitigation |\n|------|---------------|------------|\n| `1 + erf(z)` cancellation for z < -2 (loses >15 f32 bits) | 2,3,9,11,16,20 (none mode) | erfc rational fit for x < 0 path |\n| `1 + tanh(u)` cancellation for u < -2 | 5,10,12,17 (tanh mode, large neg range) | `2*sigmoid(2u)` identity |\n| `-inf * 0 = NaN` (IEEE) | 12 ([-inf,inf]) | `where(xf > -3e38, y, 0.0)` guard |\n| f16 overflow in `x^3` for large x | 10 ([-65504,65504]) | compute in promoted f32 before any cast back |\n| NaN propagation | 13 ([nan,nan]) | IEEE natural propagation matches golden |\n| bf16 erf rounds to -1.0 at z~2.1 | 3,9,16 | erfc path avoids this entirely |\n\n## Anti-cheat Constraints\n\n- ALL numerical work in `@asc2.jit` kernels on NPU\n- `torch` used ONLY for: `empty_like` (allocation), `.numel()`/`.shape`/`.dtype`/`.is_contiguous()` (metadata), `.contiguous()` (layout)\n- NO torch math ops, NO device `.to(dtype)` casts, NO caching by `data_ptr`\n- Output is contiguous NPU tensor with exact golden shape/dtype\n- `ensure_npu_platform()` called first in host wrapper\n\n## Syntax Constraints Applied\n\n- `asc2.range()` (not `range()`) inside kernels, with `unroll_factor=2` only\n- No `break`/`continue`/`return`/`print`/`import` inside `@asc2.jit`\n- Scalars on RIGHT of tile ops: `x * 0.5`, never `0.5 * x`\n- `asc.ConstExpr[int]` for tile size parameters\n- Module-level constants for all math values (`INV_SQRT2`, `SQRT_2_OVER_PI`, etc.)\n- Device functions for erfc computation (separate `@asc2.jit` function, called from kernel)\n\n## Module Structure\n\n```\ncandidate.py\n  imports: torch, asc, asc2, math, ._pyasc_runtime.ensure_npu_platform\n  constants: INV_SQRT2, SQRT_2_OVER_PI, TWO_OVER_PI_SQRT (precomputed)\n  erfc_coefficients: 9 Horner coefficients at module level\n  @asc2.jit _erfc_approx(z_abs) -> tile  (device function)\n  @asc2.jit _gelu_exact_kernel(x_ptr, out_ptr, size, num_tiles, TILE: ConstExpr)\n  @asc2.jit _gelu_tanh_kernel(x_ptr, out_ptr, size, num_tiles, TILE: ConstExpr)\n  def gelu(x, approximate=\"none\") -> Tensor  (public callable)\n```\n\n## Host Dispatch Logic\n\n```\n1. ensure_npu_platform()\n2. x = x.contiguous() if needed\n3. out = torch.empty_like(x)\n4. size = x.numel(); if 0, return out\n5. if approximate == \"none\":\n     num_tiles = ceildiv(size, TILE_EXACT=1024)\n     cores = min(72, num_tiles)\n     _gelu_exact_kernel[cores](x, out, size, num_tiles, 1024)\n   else:\n     num_tiles = ceildiv(size, TILE_TANH=2048)\n     cores = min(72, num_tiles)\n     _gelu_tanh_kernel[cores](x, out, size, num_tiles, 2048)\n6. return out\n```\n\n## Local Validation Ladder\n\n1. **Syntax gate**: `python3 -m py_compile candidate.py`\n2. **Static contract check**: worker harness validates module shape, callable signature, anti-cheat rules\n3. **Exact-v2 compile gate**: run all 20 cases through pinned pyasc v2 JIT; compile failure = repair & retry\n4. **Never claim numerical correctness** from local compile alone; only camodel or CANNBench on real NPU provides accuracy evidence\n\n## Evidence Label\n\nAll conclusions in this design: **suspected** (no execution evidence yet; local compile gate will promote to verified-local-compile upon passing all 20 cases).\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/aloschilov/workspace/pyasc-skill-stack/integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/20260902_140812/gelu-generate/design.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/20260902_140812/gelu-generate/design.md","time":{"start":1788348074118,"end":1788348074126}},"id":"prt_061d97af4001IdRGlEneXoQTRi","sessionID":"ses_f9e29a5e6ffeV9NZot5d8hM5Gt","messageID":"msg_061d66eab0015jMNq7PXDjeAvc"}}
